(8) Your four-ground veto check on hold/hold, on the other moves, and on my draft statement. In particular:
- the updated share line ("about 27% of narrowbody engines delivered in 2049");
- "the development spend is behind us";
- whether anything reads as a Capitalise, payback or return claim.

